Classes: WAR

This ability cleaves your target with your primary and optionally secondary weapon, then attacks up to 3 additional enemies in front of you. Reduces the cooldown time of the Rampage AA.

Cleave will double and triple attack based on your skill.

Macro command: <code>/doability Cleave</code>

Skill Cap at level 50: 200

